# LF in the working copy, not just in the index.
#
# The generators splice into the pages by matching literal text, newline
# included: tools/coral-gen.mjs looks for "<!-- CORAL:BEGIN (generated) -->\n"
# in atoms.html to know where to put the regrown corals. On a Windows clone
# with core.autocrlf=true that marker comes back as \r\n, the match fails, and
# `npm run build` dies with "no coral symbol to replace" on a tree that was
# never touched.
#
# Nothing in this repo is read by a tool that wants CRLF, so pin every text
# file to LF everywhere and the generators see the bytes they wrote.
* text=auto eol=lf
